Note on scope: LOCAL.md is excluded from any public distribution of this
collection. It names a specific personal toolchain, machine paths and account
access, and is not part of the shareable artefact.

A previous version of this note ended "every other file is covered by the
licence above", which made MIT the fallback for anything LICENSE-DOCS had not
been updated to list. It had not been updated for seven files. The fallback now
runs the other way: anything not in the exhaustive MIT list above is CC BY, so
a new prose file is attribution-covered the moment it exists.
